Z||000000||stimpy||07-21-2001||10:29 PM||||Just bought a new celly today. It's a Nokia 5165 that is supposed to be email ready, and it's also one of them newfangled phones that allow you to download ringer tones off the net.  So far I have been able to send test emails with it, but I can't seem to receive emails or the ringer tonez I found on <A HREF="http://www.2thumbswap.com." TARGET=_blank>www.2thumbswap.com.</A>  Am I doing something wrong, or is this something they neglected to activate with my service? Anyone have one of these toys?<BR>||||reg||5
