Z||000002||FieroLisa||07-21-2001||11:16 PM||||Nokia sucks for one :-)<P>We don't even sell those phones anymore at Sprint PCS, otherwise I would help you out!||||reg||1
Z||000003||DecadenceR||07-21-2001||11:26 PM||||Stimpy, you need to call your service provider and have them activate your text messaging. Otherwise you won't get anything.<BR>If you have Cingular, which is who I did, you have to call 611, and then tell them you need it activated. they can do it for 10 cents a message, or like $3 a month for 100, and so on.<p>[This message has been edited by DecadenceR (edited 07-22-2001).]||||reg||1
